# Noir Crafted - Cursor AI Configuration

## Project Context

This is **Noir Crafted**, a luxury jewelry e-commerce website built with SvelteKit, Tailwind CSS, and TypeScript. The project follows atomic design principles and emphasizes elegant, sophisticated design with Turkish language support.

## Brand Identity

- **Luxury jewelry brand** for women
- **Turkish language** primary (all UI in Turkish)
- **Design motifs**: Moon cycles, Virgo zodiac, Tulip, Şahmeran
- **Color palette**: Noir black (#000000), Gold accent (#FFD700), White
- **Typography**: Playfair Display (headings), Inter (body)
- **Tone**: Elegant, poetic, authentic, inspiring

## Technical Stack

- **Framework**: SvelteKit 2.x
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS 3.x
- **Language**: TypeScript (strict mode)
- **Deployment**: Vercel
- **Build**: Vite 5.x

## Code Organization

### Atomic Design Pattern
- `$atoms/` - Button, Card, Input
- `$molecules/` - ProductCard, SearchBar
- `$organisms/` - Header, Footer, Hero, ProductSection
- `$layouts/` - AppLayout, PageLayout

### Import Aliases (svelte.config.js)
- `$components` → `src/lib/components`
- `$atoms` → `src/lib/components/atoms`
- `$molecules` → `src/lib/components/molecules`
- `$organisms` → `src/lib/components/organisms`
- `$layouts` → `src/lib/components/layouts`
- `$lib` → `src/lib`
- `$types` → `src/lib/types`
- `$utils` → `src/lib/utils`
- `$stores` → `src/lib/stores`

## Component Principles

1. **TypeScript First**: All props must be typed with interfaces from `$types`
2. **Reactive**: Use Svelte reactivity (`$:`, stores) for dynamic content
3. **Accessible**: Include ARIA labels, keyboard navigation, focus states
4. **Responsive**: Mobile-first design, test all breakpoints
5. **Turkish Language**: All UI text in Turkish
6. **Elegant Styling**: Use Tailwind classes, follow design system

## Design System

### Colors
- `bg-noir-black`, `text-noir-black`
- `bg-noir-primary` (gold), `text-noir-primary`
- `bg-noir-white`, `text-noir-white`
- `bg-noir-gray-50` through `bg-noir-gray-900`

### Typography
- `font-serif` (Playfair Display)
- `font-sans` (Inter)
- `text-display-1`, `text-display-2`, `text-display-3`

### Spacing
- `container-custom` (max-w-7xl, centered, padding)

## Product Categories (Turkish)

- Kolye (Necklace)
- Bilezik (Bracelet)
- Yüzük (Ring)
- Küpe (Earring)
- Şahmeran (Shahmaran)
- Yetişkin Tokaları (Adult Hairpins)
- Fular (Scarf)

## Common UI Text (Turkish)

- Sepete Ekle (Add to Cart)
- Keşfet (Discover)
- Daha Fazla (Learn More)
- Stokta Yok (Out of Stock)
- Sepet (Cart)
- Favoriler (Favorites)
